{"id":2222,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2222"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:47:02","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:47:02","slug":"round-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/round-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Round Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Round Cardboard Boxes for Multiple Industries<\/h2>\n<p>We at <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a><\/strong> specialize in producing <strong>round cardboard boxes<\/strong> for a wide range of industries, including cosmetics, retail, food, gifts, and specialty packaging. Whether you\u2019re looking to package cookies, candles, apparel accessories, or promotional items, these unique containers offer a practical and eye-catching solution.<\/p>\n<p>Available in <strong>round cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong>, our options include various heights, diameters, and printing styles to suit your requirements. With fully customizable design support, free shipping, and fast turnaround times, we make packaging simple, fast, and efficient.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Circular Cardboard Box for Distinctive Packaging Needs<\/h2>\n<h3>A Non-Traditional Shape with Practical Benefits<\/h3>\n<p>A <strong>circular cardboard box<\/strong> is ideal when you want to break away from conventional square or rectangular packaging. The smooth, round design gives your product a sleek presence on shelves or when delivered to customers.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Suitable for candles, cookies, accessories, and more<\/li>\n<li>Available with or without lids<\/li>\n<li>Can be printed inside and out<\/li>\n<li>Great for stacking and gifting<\/li>\n<li>Holds its shape during transit<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>These boxes also offer easy closure and openability, especially when paired with matching lids and inserts.<\/p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1591\">Available in Multiple Styles and Sizes<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1800\">We offer an extensive range of round cardboard boxes bulk with the ability to meet all your dimensional and design preferences. To explore more options, check our <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"348\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"346\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/a><\/strong> collection for different formats beyond circles. Whether you need something wide and shallow or tall and narrow, we can make it.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1998\">\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1868\">\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1868\">Tall round cardboard boxes for bottles, jars, or apparel items<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1936\">\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1936\">Large round cardboard boxes for product kits or group packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1998\">\n<p data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1998\">Extra large round cardboard boxes for promotional bundles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2072\">Each box is built to hold the shape and weight of your product securely.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2356\">To explore more sizes and packaging formats beyond circular shapes, visit our Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape section for additional options like square, cube, rectangular, and mini formats.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Round Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature<\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Custom diameters &amp; heights from small to XL<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft Board, Rigid Chipboard, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Custom die-cuts, Inserts, Foam padding<\/td>\n<td>Food packaging, Gifts, Apparel, Cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Full-color CMYK &amp; PMS<\/td>\n<td>Offset &amp; Digital<\/td>\n<td>Foil stamping, Embossing, Raised ink<\/td>\n<td>Logo branding, Inside &amp; outside printing<\/td>\n<td>Brand promotion, Retail shelves<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lid Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Separate, Hinged, Window, Drawer Slide<\/td>\n<td>Eco-Kraft or Premium Board<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination, Soft Touch<\/td>\n<td>Transparent windows, Ribbon pulls<\/td>\n<td>Candle boxes, Jewelry sets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coating<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Food-safe &amp; eco coatings<\/td>\n<td>Scratch-resistant<\/td>\n<td>Anti-fingerprint finishes<\/td>\n<td>Bakery &amp; takeaway<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Quantities<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>100 \u2013 500,000 units<\/td>\n<td>Bulk order discounts<\/td>\n<td>MOQ flexibility<\/td>\n<td>Auto restock options<\/td>\n<td>Wholesale &amp; retail brands<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turnaround<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 business days<\/td>\n<td>Rush option available<\/td>\n<td>Mockups included<\/td>\n<td>Tracking updates<\/td>\n<td>Small to large-scale runs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Round Cardboard Boxes for Food and Retail Products<\/h2>\n<h3>Safe and Stylish Options for Edibles<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>round cardboard boxes for food<\/strong> are made with food-safe materials that protect contents from moisture, contamination, and air exposure. These are ideal for bakeries, confectioners, tea brands, and snack-based businesses.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Coated interiors to prevent grease penetration<\/li>\n<li>Custom dividers available for separating items<\/li>\n<li>Food-grade inks and finishes<\/li>\n<li>Durable for takeaway or gift packaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re packing truffles or biscuits, these boxes help preserve freshness while maintaining a refined presentation.<\/p>\n<h3>Retail Display and Subscription Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>Round boxes are not just limited to edibles. Many fashion and beauty brands use these containers for retail display and promotional campaigns.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fragrance boxes<\/li>\n<li>Skincare kits<\/li>\n<li>Jewelry or scarf holders<\/li>\n<li>Monthly gift subscriptions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These designs work well when paired with elegant lids and custom interior liners, which we also provide.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4644\"><strong data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4642\">Food &amp; Retail Round Boxes Features<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"5708\">\n<thead data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4777\">\n<tr data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4777\">\n<th data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4666\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4665\">Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4680\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4679\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4703\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4682\" data-end=\"4702\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4727\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4726\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4752\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4751\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4777\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4775\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"5708\">\n<tr data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"5088\">\n<td data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4931\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4930\">Food Safety<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coated interior linings<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"4989\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recyclable &amp; Food-Grade Kraft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5012\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-grease coatings<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5053\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dividers for biscuits, Truffle inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5088\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bakeries, Confectionery, Snacks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5235\">\n<td data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5106\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5105\">Durability<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Holds shape in transit<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sturdy corrugated or rigid board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5194\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Scratch-resistant coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5213\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced bases<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5235\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Takeaway, Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5402\">\n<td data-start=\"5236\" data-end=\"5257\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5256\">Retail Display<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5282\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Attractive round style<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5310\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Premium rigid &amp; chipboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5310\" data-end=\"5338\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss or Matte lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5371\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Window cutouts, Printed liners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetics, Apparel, Jewelry<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5555\">\n<td data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5427\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5426\">Subscription Kits<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5453\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Monthly packaging ready<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5453\" data-end=\"5479\" data-col-size=\"sm\">White SBS, Kraft, Rigid<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5479\" data-end=\"5501\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft touch, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"5528\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo embossing, QR codes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5528\" data-end=\"5555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Beauty boxes, Gift sets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5556\" data-end=\"5708\">\n<td data-start=\"5556\" data-end=\"5576\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5575\">Customization<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5576\" data-end=\"5609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fully brandable inside\/outside<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5609\" data-end=\"5636\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK + PMS print options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5661\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Metallic foil stamping<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5661\" data-end=\"5683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ribbons, Wrap bands<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5683\" data-end=\"5708\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Promotional campaigns<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Coating and Custom Finishing Choices<\/h2>\n<h3>Improve Appearance and Durability<\/h3>\n<p>Coating options help add shine or subtlety to your printed packaging. They also protect against fingerprints, scratches, and moisture exposure.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for high reflectivity and bright colors<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for a soft, smooth feel<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight specific design elements like logos or names<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Other available enhancements:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Foil stamping in metallic tones<\/li>\n<li>Embossing for raised textures<\/li>\n<li>Printed ribbons and branded tapes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These add value to your packaging without adding bulk or weight.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"324\"><strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"324\">Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes for Round Packaging<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"686\">\n<li data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"388\">\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"388\">Custom round cardboard boxes with printed lids and inserts<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"433\">\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"433\">Free design support and mock-up previews<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"481\">\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"481\">Fast turnaround and rush production options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"526\">\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"526\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV coatings available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"585\">\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"585\">Eco-friendly, food-grade, and durable material choices<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"643\">\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"643\">Sizes from small to extra large round cardboard boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"686\">\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"686\">Free nationwide shipping on all orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Order Round Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Bulk Orders Deliver More Benefits<\/h3>\n<p>Choosing round cardboard boxes wholesale gives you better control over your packaging cost, supply, and branding. Whether you&#8217;re launching a new product line or preparing for the holiday season, <strong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"411\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/hexagon-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"409\">Hexagon Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> bulk ordering streamlines your fulfillment.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Lower price per unit<\/li>\n<li>Faster reorder timelines<\/li>\n<li>Fewer supply chain disruptions<\/li>\n<li>Consistent color and finish<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>From <strong>small round boxes<\/strong> to <strong>extra large round cardboard boxes<\/strong>, we produce in volume without compromising quality.<\/p>\n<h3>Designed for Small Businesses and Large Brands Alike<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re a home-based brand or an established name, we offer services designed to match your scale and speed.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Low minimum order quantities<\/li>\n<li>Full-service design help included<\/li>\n<li>Quick production turnaround<\/li>\n<li>High-resolution printing and cutting<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Everything is built to serve your packaging timeline, budget, and brand identity.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Place Your Custom Round Box Order<\/h2>\n<h3>A Simple Step-by-Step Process<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your product\u2019s dimensions and design vision<\/li>\n<li>Select the material, lid type, and coating<\/li>\n<li>Upload your artwork or request design help<\/li>\n<li>Review and approve the digital mock-up<\/li>\n<li>Confirm your order for production<\/li>\n<li>Receive your boxes with free shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>We provide full transparency at every step, with ongoing communication and order tracking support.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Need round cardboard boxes for your products? Look no further. We offer high-quality round cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from durable materials and are available in a variety of sizes and styles. We also offer a variety of printing and coating options to help your boxes stand out. Get a quote today and see how we can help you package your products.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2271,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[179],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2222","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-card